Map tiles
---------

The Live and History screens fetch raster map tiles from OpenStreetMap
contributors (ODbL). Tile usage is subject to the OSM tile usage policy:
https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/

Vendor platform
---------------

API calls may reach the third-party QXGPS / gps666 cloud when you sign in with
your own account. That service is not part of this repository and is governed by
the vendor's terms.
